-- Frost Mage rework (docs/frost-mage-redesign.md, docs/frost-mage-implementation-plan.md).
-- Phase 1 "New spells" (Icicles/Glacial Spike/Shattering Cold/Flurry, IDs 200001-200004) plus
-- "Modified spells" (redesign doc section 2): Ice Lance, Cone of Cold, Ice Barrier, Amplify Magic,
-- Dampen Magic, Conjure Mana Gem's item, and Water Elemental's Freeze cooldown.
--
-- Talent-tree content (redesign doc section 4) is deliberately NOT included - it belongs in
-- apps/dbc-tools/source/talents/mage.yaml (Talent.dbc/TalentTab.dbc structure), not spell CSV rows,
-- and isn't being built yet regardless.
--
-- The spell_dbc / spellcasttimes_dbc rows below were produced by `python3 apps/dbc-tools/generate.py`
-- from apps/dbc-tools/source/spells/{mage,npc}.csv, then hand-extracted to just the rows this
-- ticket actually owns: new IDs 200001-200005, edits to 6 existing spells (30455 Ice Lance, 120
-- Cone of Cold, 11426 Ice Barrier, 1008 Amplify Magic, 604 Dampen Magic, 33395 Water Elemental's
-- Freeze), and spellcasttimes_dbc row 30007 (Glacial Spike's 2.5s cast). See each row's `notes`
-- column in mage.csv/npc.csv for what changed and why.
--
-- NOT included: a full `generate.py` run also reproduces a pre-existing, unrelated diff touching
-- ~565 other spells across other classes (Lifebloom, Circle of Healing, Riptide, ...) and several
-- other spellcasttimes_dbc rows - reproducible on this branch (frost-mage-rework) by running
-- generate.py with no source changes at all, so it predates and is unrelated to this ticket.
-- Flagged for the user/whoever owns the single-rank conversion work to investigate separately;
-- deliberately not folded in here.
--
-- Regenerate/extend via: python3 apps/dbc-tools/generate.py (see apps/dbc-tools/README.md)

DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (200001, 200002, 200003, 200004, 200005, 30455, 120, 11426, 1008, 604, 33395);
